{"id":"n72476-1-9","stage":1,"title":"햇빛 · 阳光","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72476-1-9-1","ko":"왜 캄캄하게 커튼을 다 쳐 놨어?","zh":"为什么把窗帘都拉得严严实实的，这么黑啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"캄캄하게","meaning":"漆黑，黑洞洞","explanation":"캄캄하다：漆黑，黑洞洞；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"캄캄하다","audio":"/audio/729a6793c9d20302a88b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28142","senseId":"1","lemma":"캄캄하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"캄캄하게","audio":"/audio/e166e3a87c7490c92285.mp3"}},{"text":"커튼을","meaning":"窗帘","explanation":"커튼：窗帘；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"커튼","audio":"/audio/11324bd0fb7b6e5f051f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72166","senseId":"1","lemma":"커튼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커튼을","audio":"/audio/f4fb13904b5a37429336.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"쳐","meaning":"搭，拉，支，架","explanation":"치다：搭，拉，支，架；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28128","senseId":"1","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쳐","audio":"/audio/67f68907535c3fdeaceb.mp3"}},{"text":"놨어?","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놨어","audio":"/audio/8e2ef783df68eea8f847.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"729a6793c9d20302","term":"캄캄하다","zh":"漆黑，黑洞洞","audio":"/audio/729a6793c9d20302a88b.mp3","entryId":"28142","definition":"非常暗，到看不清楚的程度。","pronunciation":["캄캄하다"]},{"id":"11324bd0fb7b6e5f","term":"커튼","zh":"窗帘","audio":"/audio/11324bd0fb7b6e5f051f.mp3","entryId":"72166","definition":"为了遮挡窗或门而挂在其上方的长形垂布。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"搭，拉，支，架","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"28128","definition":"用窗帘、拐角屏风、帷帐等围住边缘或使其垂下。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b2209c5d4af2af2b667.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72476-1-9-2","ko":"햇빛이 너무 강해서.","zh":"因为阳光太强烈了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"햇빛이","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇빛：阳光，日光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"햇빛","audio":"/audio/53e1a4a868c33516d0ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72476","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"햇빛이","audio":"/audio/dcaf66afddf093c6d9a8.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"강해서.","meaning":"强，强大","explanation":"강